        body: 'Hi there,\n\nWe have three aircons at our office in Centurion that haven\'t been serviced in two years. One is dripping. How much to service all three, and can you come next week? Mornings are better.\n\nThanks\nThandi',
        reason: 'A quote request it can answer from your price list; the day needs checking against the diary.',
